<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90553" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προτρέχω</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προὔδρᾰμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					3.2.8
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.5.2
			</span></i>:—<i>run forward</i> or <i>forth</i>, Il.cc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ δένδρου δύο βήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.7.10
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλμινθες] τῷ στομάχῳ προτρέχουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.Med.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				9.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>run in advance of, outrun</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στάδια πέντε τῶν ὁπλιτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.2.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλοῖς ἡ γλῶττα προτρέχει τῆς
					διανοίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					1.41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ κοπριζόμενα τῶν ἀκόπρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					8.7.7
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ προτρέχουσα εἰκασία</span> the
				<i>foregoing</i> simile, <i><span class="en">
				Heraclit.
				<u>All.</u>
				5
			</span></i>.</div>
